        "heading": "RELENTLESS PROGRESSION. FEARLESS EXPRESSION.",
        "content": "<p>Thread® was born out of a need for expression and function. Life comes with stuff to carry, but who said that has to be boring and inconvenient? For us, it started with <a href=\"/collections/all-wallets\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"/collections/all-wallets\">wallets</a>. We overturned everything about the traditional wallet—you know, that big, ugly one that your dad has had for decades—and brought life to a category saturated with bulky and boring. We replaced the bulk with slim silhouettes that don’t weigh you down, and traded boring designs for a huge variety of original colorways. From there, we expanded into <a href=\"/collections/lanyards\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"/collections/lanyards\">lanyards</a>, <a href=\"/collections/all-bags\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"All Bags Collection\">bags</a>, <a href=\"/collections/chapstick-holder-keychains\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Chapstick Holders\">lip balm holders</a>, and more <a href=\"/collections/all-accessories\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Thread Wallet Accessories\">accessories</a> made to hold your daily essentials. Check out Thread® products designed to express your originality with every outing and errand. We’re redefining the way you carry, and making sure you look damn good while doing it. </p>",
